    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Variable window - shortest covering</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-window-substring/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 76</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Minimum Window Substring</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Grow the right edge until the window covers t, then shrink the left edge while it still covers t, recording the shortest. A single \"missing\" counter makes the cover check O(1). O(m + n) time, O(alphabet) space.</p>\n"
  },
